+
+The dependency inventory
+[70-proof-dependencies.log](/audit-output/evidence/70-proof-dependencies.log)
+confirms the intended acyclic structure:
+
+1. `CONNECTION-SPEC` imports `connection.k`, not
+   `verification-base.k`.
